{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/XFreeze/status/2015067284205916553","id":"2015067284205916553","text":"Elon Musk: The single biggest thing you can do to lift people out of poverty is giving them an internet connection\n\nWe can provide low-cost, high-bandwidth internet to parts of the world that don't have it, or where it’s very expensive\n\nI think the single biggest thing you can do to lift people out of poverty and help them is giving them an internet connection because once you have the internet connection, you can learn anything for free on the internet and you can also sell your goods and services to the global market\n\nSpaceX has a very dominant position in space launches. So, of the mass launch to orbit this year, SpaceX will probably do 90%\n\nAt this point, maybe approaching 80% of all active satellites in orbit are SpaceX, and they're providing high-bandwidth global connectivity throughout the world","raw_text":{"text":"Elon Musk: The single biggest thing you can do to lift people out of poverty is giving them an internet connection\n\nWe can provide low-cost, high-bandwidth internet to parts of the world that don't have it, or where it’s very expensive\n\nI think the single biggest thing you can do to lift people out of poverty and help them is giving them an internet connection because once you have the internet connection, you can learn anything for free on the internet and you can also sell your goods and services to the global market\n\nSpaceX has a very dominant position in space launches. So, of the mass launch to orbit this year, SpaceX will probably do 90%\n\nAt this point, maybe approaching 80% of all active satellites in orbit are SpaceX, and they're providing high-bandwidth global connectivity throughout the world","display_text_range":[0,813],"facets":[{"type":"bold","indices":[0,115]},{"type":"media","indices":[281,304],"id":"2015067208188116992","display":"pic.x.com/1xiTmXiP5n","original":"https://t.co/1xiTmXiP5n",